abstract: >-
  R code accompanying Wintermantel et al., "Equivalence testing in pesticide risk
  assessment: Evaluation and practical guidance for design, analysis and
  interpretation". The repository contains the simulation scenarios, the
  equivalence-testing functions, the anticlustering-based balanced allocation
  function, and the scripts that generate the figures in the paper.
